# 🔄 Palindrome Checker

A clean and interactive **Palindrome Checker** built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**. This application allows users to enter a word, validates the input, reverses the text, and determines whether the entered word is a palindrome. The project provides instant feedback with an animated result display and user-friendly error messages.

---

## 📌 Features

* Simple and attractive user interface
* Real-time palindrome checking
* Reverse word generation
* Input validation with descriptive error messages
* Animated result display
* Keyboard support (Press Enter to check)
* Responsive design
* Smooth visual effects and transitions

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript (Vanilla JS)

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
Palindrome-Checker/
│
├── index.html      # Main application page
├── style.css       # Styling and animations
├── script.js       # Palindrome checking logic
└── README.md       # Project documentation
```

---

## 🚀 How It Works

### Step 1: Enter a Word

The user enters a word into the input field.

Example:

```text
rotator
```

---

### Step 2: Input Validation

Before checking the palindrome, the application validates the input using the following rules:

* Input cannot be empty.
* Only alphabetic characters (A–Z) are allowed.
* Spaces, numbers, and special characters are not allowed.
* Minimum length must be 3 characters.
* Maximum length must not exceed 20 characters.

If any validation fails, an appropriate error message is displayed.

---

### Step 3: Reverse the Word

The application reverses the entered word using JavaScript string manipulation.

Example:

```text
Original Word : rotator
Reversed Word : rotator
```

---

### Step 4: Palindrome Check

The application compares the original word with its reversed version.

* If both are identical, the word is a **Palindrome**.
* Otherwise, it is **Not a Palindrome**.

The result is displayed with an animated verdict.

---

## 📋 Examples

| Input   | Reversed | Result             |
| ------- | -------- | ------------------ |
| madam   | madam    | ✅ Palindrome       |
| level   | level    | ✅ Palindrome       |
| racecar | racecar  | ✅ Palindrome       |
| hello   | olleh    | ❌ Not a Palindrome |
| apple   | elppa    | ❌ Not a Palindrome |

---

## ✅ Input Validation

The application performs the following validations:

* Empty input validation
* Alphabet-only validation
* Minimum character length validation
* Maximum character length validation

These validations ensure accurate and reliable palindrome checking.

---

## 🔄 Application Workflow

```text
Enter Word
     │
     ▼
Validate Input
     │
     ▼
Reverse Word
     │
     ▼
Compare Original & Reversed
     │
 ┌───┴────┐
 │        │
 ▼        ▼
Match   No Match
 │        │
 ▼        ▼
Palindrome  Not a Palindrome
```

